stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> active: Platform: POST /v1/identifiers/{datasetId}<br/>(XSD valid → INSERT consignments + identifiers)

    [*] --> rejected: XSD invalid<br/>(JAXB throws → 400 INVALID_XML, no DB write)
    rejected --> [*]

    active --> active: Platform: POST /v1/identifiers/{datasetId}<br/>(re-upload — INSERT new consignments row, replaces previous)

    active --> inactive: IdentifierExpirationJob<br/>(mode='road' AND transport_date + 14 days < NOW())<br/>UPDATE consignments SET status='inactive'<br/>per Reg 2024/1942 Art 11(4) — cabotage retention

    inactive --> active: rare — re-registration of same datasetId<br/>(treated as a new consignment row)

    active --> deleted: Admin: DELETE /api/v1/consignments/{datasetId}<br/>UPDATE consignments SET status='deleted'<br/>(soft delete — row retained for audit)
    inactive --> deleted: Admin: DELETE /api/v1/consignments/{datasetId}<br/>UPDATE consignments SET status='deleted'

    note right of active
        Status enum value: 'active'
        - Authority search returns this consignment.
        - Dataset XML retrievable via GET /v1/dataset/...
        - Indexed via consignments denormalised columns
          (vehicle_plate, vehicle_country, mode, …).
    end note

    note right of inactive
        Status enum value: 'inactive'
        - Authority default search excludes (status=active filter).
        - Returned only with explicit status=inactive|all
          (cabotage queries: dateFrom/dateTo + status=inactive).
        - Dataset XML still retrievable via direct UIL.
    end note

    note right of deleted
        Status enum value: 'deleted'
        - Soft delete: row retained for audit retention.
        - DELETE never granted to the runtime app role.
        - Excluded from all default queries (status=active filter).
        - Physical removal only via partition rotation by maintenance role.
    end note
